.SH NAME
awww\-clear\-cache
.PP
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBawww clear\-cache\fR
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
.RS 4
Print help (see a summary with '\&\-h'\&)
.PP
.RE
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Deletes the \fBawww\fR cache directory.\&
.PP
The cache resides at \fI$XDG_CACHE_HOME/awww\fR or \fI$HOME/.\&cache/awww\fR
if $XDG_CACHE_HOME does not exist.\& In this directory, we create another
directory corresponding to \fBawww\fRs current version number.\& In there, we have
files that cache the last displayed image and animation frames for animated
wallpapers.\& There is one file per output.\&
.PP
Note that \fBawww\fR will automatically delete any files and directories in 
\fI$XDG_CACHE_HOME/awww\fR that do not correspond to the exact current \fBawww\fR
version number.\& This is to ensure we only keep cache files for the latest
\fBawww\fR version.\&
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBawww\-img\fR(1)
